{
  "version": "0.2-draft",
  "as_of": "2026-10-07",
  "notes": [
    "Draft v0.2 after the 7 Oct 2026 test capture. Terms are written in natural Arabic; build_etimad.py normalises them the same way as titles before matching (diacritics, tatweel, zero-width removed; NFKC; أ/إ/آ→ا, ى→ي, ة→ه, Persian ی/ک→ي/ك).",
    "Each word may carry the prefixes ال / وال / بال / لل / ل / و / ب / ف, and the last word may carry the endings ه / ات / يه, so 'تصريح بيئي' also matches 'التصاريح البيئية' only if the plural is listed: plurals are listed explicitly.",
    "نفايات and مخلفات are synonyms: any term containing one is also tried with the other.",
    "requires_service_verb: the title must also contain one of service_verbs, otherwise the tender is treated as supply of goods (Not EH).",
    "Changes from v0.1 are marked with \"added_v02\".",
    "supply_goods_nouns (added v0.2): a title that starts with a supply word followed by one of these nouns is supply of goods even if it contains a service word (e.g. 'توريد عربة نقل النفايات الطبية')."
  ],
